        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tab General: Metadata Entry",
          "desc": "Tab **General** menampilkan informasi lengkap Stop List entry:\n• **Attribute Type**: Jenis atribut transaksi yang diblokir (Card Number, IP Address, Email, dll).\n• **Attribute Value**: Nilai spesifik yang diblokir, ditampilkan dengan format monospace untuk readability.\n• **Date From / Date To**: Periode berlakunya blocking, dengan format timestamp lengkap (dd/MM/yyyy HH:mm:ss).\n• **Reason**: Penjelasan mengapa entry ini dibuat.\n• **Action Insight**: Catatan bahwa untuk melihat detail lengkap transaksi yang terblokir, gunakan tombol **View Reactions**.\n\n> Layout menggunakan 2-column grid yang responsive dengan icon berwarna sesuai kategori metadata."
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Tab History: Audit Timeline",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tab **History** menampilkan kronologi lengkap setiap perubahan pada Stop List entry.\n• Timeline visual menampilkan: Initiator (user), Timestamp, Description (aksi yang dilakukan), dan Status.\n• Tombol **Expand Timeline** di pojok kanan atas membuka modal fullscreen untuk melihat history secara lebih detail.\n• History di-fetch on-demand (lazy loading) saat tab History pertama kali dibuka untuk optimasi performa.",
          "color": "#7c3aed",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(124,58,237,.12);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#ede9fe);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:16px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#a78bfa;\">General</div><div style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;\">● History</div></div><div style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:14px;background:#7c3aed;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">↗ Expand</div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;\">Audit Cycle</div><div style=\"position:relative;padding-left:20px;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7px;top:0;bottom:0;width:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#7c3aed,#d8b4fe);\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#7c3aed;border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #7c3aed;\"></div><div style=\"background:#faf5ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;margin-bottom:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#7c3aed;\">admin@system.com</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:600;\">2 hrs ago</div></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;margin-bottom:4px;\">Entry created with blocking rule</div><div style=\"padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#dcfce7;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;display:inline-block;\">✓ ACTIVE</div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#a78bfa;border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #a78bfa;\"></div><div style=\"background:#faf5ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;margin-bottom:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#7c3aed;\">security@team.com</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:600;\">5 hrs ago</div></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;margin-bottom:4px;\">Verified fraud pattern from IP</div><div style=\"padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;display:inline-block;\">⚡ VERIFIED</div></div></div><div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#d8b4fe;border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #d8b4fe;\"></div><div style=\"background:#faf5ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;margin-bottom:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#7c3aed;\">risk@ops.com</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:600;\">1 day ago</div></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;margin-bottom:4px;\">Initial detection from rule #312</div><div style=\"padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#fed7aa;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#ea580c;display:inline-block;\">⚠ DETECTED</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
